OL,3,GNEWSASwimmers hit with second sewage
OL,4,Awarning in a week
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwimmers have been warned to avoid the
OL,7,Fwater at Plymouth Hoe due to sewage
OL,8,Fdischarge from a storm overflow just
OL,9,Fdays after a previous incident was
OL,10,Fcleared.
OL,12,FThe Environment Agency (EA) issued the
OL,13,Fadvice for Plymouth Hoe West and
OL,14,FPlymouth Hoe East on Friday after an
OL,15,F"unpermitted discharge" due to
OL,16,Foperational issues at Plymouth Central
OL,17,FWastewater Treatment Works.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
