OL,3,GNEWSASwimmers hit with second sewage
OL,4,Awarning in a week
OL,5,
OL,6,FBathing was also halted last week after
OL,7,Fa separate discharge of sewage. MP Luke
OL,8,FPollard said "the situation is quickly
OL,9,Fbecoming a farce" and he was
OL,10,F"disgusted" with South West Water.
OL,12,FThe water company said it understood
OL,13,Fthe concern such advice can cause and
OL,14,Fsaid it was working closely with the
OL,15,FEA.
